{"id":"I-0312","status":"open","body":"Printable blueprint warning debt

Two settled full LuaLaTeX passes now produce a 619-page PDF with 742 overfull boxes and 96 missing-character notices. There are zero underfull boxes and no unresolved references or citations, rerun request, duplicate Adelic labels, or TeX error. The rewritten RiemannRoch_Adelic chapter contributes no chapter-local diagnostic. This improves the preceding 618-page, 759-overfull baseline while glyph debt stays flat. Continue with the worst remaining chapter-local overflows and central rendering of Greek glyphs in code-style names. Latest chapter commit: 053970b58."}
{"id":"I-0314","status":"closed","body":"Blueprint journal cleanup

Resolved. Eleven bounded chapter passes now read as timeless mathematics, culminating in RiemannRoch_Adelic. The final pass separates function-field and sheaf comparisons, fixes residue-weighted degree and duality signs, replaces development tiers with complete sourced proofs, and leaves genuinely open sheaf-level results unpinned. Independent review, graph sync, settled print, and full Lean build all pass. Final commits: 053970b58 and 03889996b."}
{"id":"I-0315","status":"closed","body":"Lean warning debt in the Cech consumer closure

Resolved. The original warning cluster in QcohRestrictBasicOpen, QcohTildeSections, CechBridge, CechToCohomology, AffineSerreVanishing, OpenImmersionPushforward, and CechTermAcyclic is warning-free under the relevant LSP and kernel checks. Generic exact-augmentation lemmas in AcyclicResolution replace the specialized 4M-heartbeat augmented-cycle adapter; the full CechToHigherDirectImage closure rebuilt without warnings in 5:44.49, and the capstone elaborated in about 8.7 seconds. CechTermAcyclic is also decoupled from the contractibility import chain. Closure commit: 96916900a."}
{"id":"I-0316","status":"open","body":"Project-wide blueprint pins need declaration audit

The current full graph contains 1,912 blueprint nodes, 4,327 Lean nodes, 6,239 live nodes total, and 6,670 edges. The generated-node ledger is stale-free after pruning 188 vanished nodes (182 Lean and 6 blueprint); 33 classified unresolved-pin warnings remain. None is in the Adelic chapter, and the Grassmannian signature generalization plus Cech option cleanup introduced no new unresolved pin. Keep this issue open for remaining scanner coverage and genuine forward contracts. Graph commits: ec8301ef0, 0cd05df34."}
{"id":"I-0319","status":"open","body":"Lean full-build warning and resource baseline

The affected-cone full build after the Grassmannian and Cech cleanups passes all 8,723 jobs in 15:48.40 at 8,677,384 KiB peak RSS and reports 201 warning heads across 30 files, down from 245. GrassmannianZariskiSheaf is warning-free after removing its 44-diagnostic block. Five CechTerm synthesis scopes and three Cech contraction recursion-depth scopes are gone; all eight declarations elaborate at defaults. The current inventory is 140 maxHeartbeats, 39 synthesis-heartbeat, 15 synthesis-pending-depth, and 5 recursion-depth scopes. Changed modules emit no warnings. Keep this issue open for residual warnings, resource scopes, and umbrella-import review. Commits: 773efe164, 5edda3284."}

